{"id":"n26908-1-2","stage":1,"title":"팔십 · 八十","scene":"询问身高","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26908-1-2-1","ko":"키가 꽤 커 보이는데 얼마나 되니?","zh":"你看着个子挺高，有多高？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"키가","meaning":"身高、个子","explanation":"키：人的身高；가 标记主语，这里说对方看起来个子挺高。","readings":[{"term":"키","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20269","senseId":"1","lemma":"키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"키가","audio":"/audio/26f2f72df3c979a9df96.mp3"}},{"text":"꽤","meaning":"颇，相当，还","explanation":"꽤：颇，相当，还。","readings":[{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38264","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}},{"text":"커","meaning":"高","explanation":"크다：高；키가 크다 是“个子高”，不是东西体积大。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커","audio":"/audio/768798e62994baaa085d.mp3"}},{"text":"보이는데","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이는데","audio":"/audio/9605d72ec6eda39718b1.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多高","explanation":"얼마나：多少；这里询问身高有多高。","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"되니?","meaning":"有多少","explanation":"되다：数量达到多少；되니? 用非敬语询问对方的身高。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"5","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되니","audio":"/audio/49977e7991da87edfe97.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e37db65fd90db469","term":"키","zh":"身高、个子","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3","entryId":"20269","definition":"人的身体高度；这里询问对方有多高。","pronunciation":["키"]},{"id":"130a398219d202b0","term":"꽤","zh":"颇，相当，还","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3","entryId":"38264","definition":"预期或期待以上，相当。","pronunciation":["꽤"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"高","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"키가 크다 指个子高。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多高、多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"询问程度或数量；这里问身高。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"有、达到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"数量达到某数值；这里询问身高。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/12e7b3fabef291c42c20.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26908-1-2-2","ko":"일 미터 팔십이 좀 넘어요.","zh":"一米八十多一点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일","meaning":"一","explanation":"일：一。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31523","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}},{"text":"미터","meaning":"米","explanation":"미터：米。","readings":[{"term":"미터","audio":"/audio/489fc50fd43c76e8813b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58160","senseId":"1","lemma":"미터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미터","audio":"/audio/489fc50fd43c76e8813b.mp3"}},{"text":"팔십이","meaning":"八十（厘米）","explanation":"팔십：八十；팔십이 좀 넘어요 省略厘米单位，表示身高略高于一米八十。","readings":[{"term":"팔십","audio":"/audio/97108fcb6a0f17706307.mp3"}]